REG_META source_url for GP01-GP12 now points at the OnBase DocPop document that
CDPHE's general-air-permits page itself links for each permit, instead of the
generic general-air-permits index. The docids equal those recorded in
pipeline/sources/manifest.json for the imported issuances (checked 2026-10-03:
the live page's 11 hrefs match the manifest exactly).

